  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Study Room API",
    "description": "study-room Spring Boot API (local dev)\n\n## Variables\n- `baseUrl`: http://localhost:8080\n- `accessToken`: set by **Login — success** or **Refresh — success** test script\n- `refreshToken`: set by **Login — success** test script\n- `testEmail` / `testPassword`: default test user credentials\n\n## Auth\n- Public: `/actuator/health`, `/api/v1/rooms/**`, `/api/v1/auth/**`\n- JWT required: everything else (e.g. `/api/v1/me`, `/actuator/info`)\n- Send `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}` on protected requests\n\n## Suggested flow\n1. **Signup — success** (or use existing user)\n2. **Login — success** → saves `accessToken` + `refreshToken`\n3. **Refresh — success** → updates `accessToken` (no Bearer needed)\n4. **Get me — success**",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "testEmail",
      "value": "user1@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "testPassword",
      "value": "Password123"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
